========================================================================
  SYNTHESIS: THE OCR FORMULA
========================================================================

  THEORETICAL E[H^2] COMPUTATION:
  E[H^2] = sum_{sigma,tau in S_n} 2^{-|E(sigma) union E(tau)|}
  where E(sigma) = arcs used by permutation sigma as a HP

